        "TileImage": "$($repository 645d1646-c910-4d8a-9f9a-b39aca226eef).Image",
        "Description": "One of our Intelligence officers that has infiltrated deep within the Argentinian Government has found intel relating to a plan to assasinate your close friend and collegue Diana Burnwood. The only information we have is that 2 snipers have been hired to do the job. The cover story from the Argentinian Government is that the snipers are only there for security purposes. The mission is for Agent 47 to seek out and take down the snipers. Use explosives, i want it to look like a terror attack!",
